### GET request to example server
GET http://localhost:8080

###clienti
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clients
###creare client
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "andrei",
  "taxId": "1232523523",
  "email": "andrei@yahoo.com"
}

###update client
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/clients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "andrei modificat",
  "taxId": "999993",
  "email": "andrei.nou@yahoo.com"
}

###stergere client
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/clients/1



###produse
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

###creare produs
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "curent",
  "unitPrice": "2.67",
  "vatRate": "0.5"
}

###editare produs
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "gaz",
  "unitPrice": "4.2",
  "vatRate": "1.2"
}

###stergere produs
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/2

###facturi
GET http://localhost:8080/api/invoices

###creare invoice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": 1,
  "invoiceLineRequestList": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

###update invoice status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/invoices/5/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PAID"
}